# PSR-4b-host-imports-4 — careful shrink (3 → 2)

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| Route migrate SoT/schema/wrap via `canonicalTour` binding | Yes |
| Remove denali import from `migrate-canonical-workspace.service.ts` | Yes |
| Finance ledger exclusive denali imports | **No** |
| Equipment icon settings contract | **No** (keep) |

## Binding surface (Denali)

Optional `canonicalTour` exports (same `./acl` module as migrate):

- `legacySoTRootExport`
- `currentSchemaVersionExport`
- `legacySchemaVersionExport`
- `wrapLegacyExport`

Host resolves these by `workspaceType`; batch migrate and envelope helpers no longer import `@app-tour/workspace-denali` directly.

